 ],
 "strings": {
  "He died in the hospital three weeks later.": "",
  "There was clear evidence of physical assault,\nand he died in the hospital three weeks later.": "",
  "The culprit is still at large.\nDid you know of this case?": "",
  "...It's the first I've heard of it.": "",
  "Actually, it's the first I've heard of it.": "",
  "Understandable.\nIt didn't make many headlines.": "",
  "Understandable, considering it didn't\nreally make headlines.": "",
  "Incidentally, this Hashiki guy\nhad a pretty big secret.": "",
  "Turns out he was working for the Kajihira Group,\na massive construction company based out of Kansai.": "",
  "He was working for the Kajihira Group,\na massive construction company based out of Kansai.": "",
  "Kajihira was planning to redevelop\nthe land the ADDC sits on.": "",
  "And Kajihira? He was planning to redevelop\nthe land the ADDC sits on.": "",
  "He'd already settled it with the Minister of Health.\nHad the Kyorei Clan muscle in on the turf, too.": "",
  "He had the Kyorei muscle in on their turf,\nand even made arrangements with the Minister of Health.": "",
  "But the plan fell apart when AD-9 was announced.\nKajihira ended up taking a pretty big hit.": "",
  "To the tune of a hundred billion yen.": "",
  "That's when Hashiki came in, swearing to Kajihira\nthat he'd scuttle AD-9, no matter what it took.": "",
  "That's when Hashiki came in, swearing to Kajihira\nthat he'd get rid of AD-9 no matter what.": "",
  "Just before he was beaten half to death,\nHashiki went out with another member of the ADDC.": "",
  "Just before he was beaten half to death in Kamurocho,\nHashiki met with another member of the ADDC.": "",
  "Someone deeply involved in the development of AD-9.\nSomeone he thought he could manipulate.": "",
  "Hashiki went drinking with a colleague.\nSomeone deeply involved in the development of AD-9.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Who was the ADDC employee that\nHashiki met with before he got killed?)</color>": "",
  "It was her.": "",
  "This is who.": "",
  "And... Wait, you of all people should \nknow it couldn't be Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa was involved with AD-9?\nIn what capacity?": "",
  "Hm? Oh yeah, right.\nUh, clearly.": "",
  "Hm? Wait, sorry.\nIt wasn't her.": "",
  "I'm sure you recognize this man,\nIzumida-san.": "",
  "I'm sure Prosecutor Izumida\nrecognizes this man.": "",
  "Three years ago, he testified about the murder\nthat had taken place at the ADDC.": "",
  "He claimed he had seen the victim,\na patient by the name of Waku, still alive.": "",
  "According to his testimony, he'd seen the victim,\nWaku-san, while he was alive.": "",
  "I remember him.\nYou're referring to Dr. Shono.": "",
  "I remember.\nHe's the researcher, Shono.": "",
  "Mmhm. He's also the head\nof the AD-9 research team.": "",
  "Yeah. He's also the head of\nthe AD-9 research team.": "",
  "Hashiki was grilling Shono, convinced that there\nwas something fishy going on with AD-9.": "",
  "Hashiki was interrogating Shono, convinced\nthere was something fishy going on with AD-9.": "",
  "He thought they had fabricated data.\nAnd falsified the effects of the drug.": "",
  "He believed they had fabricated data.\nAnd falsified the effects of the drug.": "",
  "After all, it wasn't until rumors of closing the ADDC\nstarted swirling that Director Kido suddenly announced AD-9.": "",
  "After all, Director Kido announced AD-9 so suddenly.\nRight when talks of closing the ADDC began.": "",
  "Hashiki was convinced it was all too\nconvenient to be coincidence.": "",
  "By Hashiki's estimation, looking at the facts,\nit was all too convenient to be coincidence.": "",
  "But that doubt didn't sit well with those who\nstood to rake in massive profits off AD-9's development.": "",
  "Unfortunately for him, that doubt was inconvenient\nfor those who stood to profit massively off of AD-9.": "",
  "Are you implying...\nHashiki's murder was premeditated?": "",
  "Does that mean... Hashiki's murder in Kamurocho\nwas premeditated?": "",
  "Sounds like we're finally\non the same page, Izumida-san.": "",
  "Nice. Looks like I'm not the\nonly one with any sense around here.": "",
  "I had the exact same thought.": "",
  "I had the exact same thought,\nProsecutor Izumida.": "",
  "Taking all this into account, doesn't it seem like\nthere really is something fishy about AD-9?": "",
  "Taking all this into account, doesn't it seem like\nthere really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> something fishy about AD-9?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That should do it for the explanation of AD-9.\nNow to bring this full circle.)</color>": "",
  "But let's get back to Shintani.": "",
  "That all said,\nlet's get back to Shintani.": "",
  "Just before he was murdered, he called the ADDC\nand tried to get in touch with a very specific someone.": "",
  "Maybe that phone call provoked whoever is trying\nto hide the truth about AD-9.": "",
  "Maybe... that phone call provoked whoever is\ntrying to hide the truth about AD-9.": "",
  "Shintani was an obstacle, just like Hashiki.\nAnd he had to be removed.": "",
  "Just like Hashiki, they saw Shintani\nas an obstacle to be dealt with.": "",
  "What I'm saying is...": "",
  "There's a chance anyone who gets too close to learning\nthe true nature of AD-9 is being murdered.": "",
  "There's a chance someone is silencing anyone who\ngets too close to learning the true nature of AD-9.": "",
  "And if you haven't investigated down that path,\nthen one thing's pretty clear.": "",
  "One thing's for sure.\nIf you haven't even started investigating that...": "",
  "You have a lot more work to do before you\ncan arrest me. Wouldn't you say?": "",
  "You've got a hell of a lot of work to do\nbefore you try arresting me, don't you!?": "",
  "Answer me, Izumida!": "",
  "If you still want to bring me in,\nlet's see some proof.": "",
  "If you still want to bring me in,\nshow me some proof.": "",
  "All these prosecutors,\nand nobody's got any proof?": "",
  "At least <font_kind=yakuza_italic>one</font_kind> of you\nhas to have some proof.": "",
  "That's quite a theory, Yagami-san.\nTruly fascinating.": "",
  "That's quite a theory.\nTruly fascinating.": "",
  "There were details in there even we weren't aware of.\nYou've clearly done your homework.": "",
  "I'd be glad to hand over\nmy findings if it'll help.": "",
  "After all, AD-9's practically\na household name at this point.": "",
  "AD-9's practically a household name\nat this point.": "",
  "Lifting the lid on it might be too much\nfor me to handle all on my own.": "",
  "Lifting the lid might be too much for\nme to handle all on my own.": "",
  "And besides, I think I'd rather work\nwith you than Izumida here.": "",
  "Izumida's never done much to help me.\nMaybe you'll be different.": "",
  "Director Kido was meeting\nHashiki in Kamurocho?": "",
  "Director Kido was meeting Hashiki\nin Kamurocho?": "",
  "Hm? Wait, I'm not sure\nI have that right.": "",
  "Hm? Wait... That's not right.": "",
  "Hmph. Get your facts straight.": "",
  "Honestly... Get your facts straight.": "",
  "(Hoshino-kun should've made the arrangements to see Ayabe.\nGuess I should head over to Genda's.)": "",
  "Yagami-san. I've been waiting for you.": "",
  "We can go see Ayabe whenever you want.\nWe'll just need to grab a taxi to get there.": "",
  "We can go see Ayabe whenever you want.\nWe'll just need a taxi.": "",
  "Hey, good luck down at the station.": "",
  "It seems the news of Ayabe's arrest\nis spreading like wildfire.": "",
  "News of Ayabe's arrest traveled fast.\nIt's spreading like wildfire.": "",
  "An on-duty detective, arrested\nfor murder. Now this is a shock.": "",
  "An active detective, arrested for murder.\nShocking development, huh?": "",
  "Try not to look so happy about it then.": "",
  "Try saying it without a smile\nnext time.": "",
  "This is Hoshino-sensei, from the Genda Law Office.\nHe's young, but he's reliable.": "",
  "Oh, here I thought the great\nTakayuki Yagami would represent me.": "",
  "Hey, I thought you were\nrepresenting me.": "",
  "It's been years since\nI've defended someone in court.": "",
  "It's been years since I've\ndefended someone in court.": "",
  "I'll still be gathering all the evidence,\nthough. Don't worry, it worked for Hamura.": "",
  "I'll still be gathering all the evidence, though.\nDon't worry, it worked for Hamura.": "",
  "I'm Hoshino. I'll do whatever\nit takes to clear your name.": "",
  "I'm Hoshino.\nI'm here to help.": "",
  "You sure, kid?": "",
  "...You sure?": "",
  "Shintani was practically your boss,\nyeah? If I'm really the killer...": "",
  "Shintani was practically your boss, yeah?\nIf I'm really the killer...": "",
  "Well, I mean...\nYou're not the killer, right?": "",
  "Well, I mean... You're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> the killer,\nare you?": "",
  "He's not the killer, is he?": "",
  "Uh... Right? He's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind>, is he?": "",
  "...Probably not.": "",
  "Hmm. Probably not.": "",
  "What do you mean, probably?": "",
  "What do you mean, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>probably</font_kind>?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I need to get the facts straight\nbefore I can defend Ayabe.)</color>": "",
  "I hear your gun's the one\nShintani was murdered with.": "",
  "So Shintani was killed with your gun, huh?\nAccording to the prosecution, anyway.": "",
  "Yup. Apparently the rifling\non the bullet matched.": "",
  "Um... what's rifling again?": "",
  "Excuse me, but...\nWhat's a rifling?": "",
  "...Sorry.": "",
  "Sorry...": "",
  "So. Guns have these spiral-shaped grooves on the\ninside of the barrel to stabilize the bullet's trajectory.": "",
  "So guns have these spiral-shaped grooves on the inside\nof the barrel, to stabilize the bullet's trajectory.": "",
  "These grooves are called the rifling,\nand leave a mark on the bullet itself.": "",
  "See, these grooves are called the rifling.\nThey leave a mark on the bullet itself.": "",
  "Now the rifling's slightly different\non every gun, kinda like its fingerprints.": "",
  "Now each gun's got it's own distinctive rifling,\nkinda like its fingerprints. They're all different.": "",
  "And apparently, the marks on the bullet\nthat killed Shintani matched my gun's rifling.": "",
  "And, apparently, they found a match to the bullets\nthat killed Shintani. It's the rifling from my gun.": "",
  "So your gun must have\nkilled Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "So the weapon that killed Shintani-sensei...\nwas definitely your firearm.": "",
  "Yeah, it was the murder weapon for sure.": "",
  "Yup. It was the murder weapon\nfor sure.": "",
  "So someone used my gun to commit\nthe crime, and I'm being set up.": "",
  "That means one thing.\nSomebody set me up.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Someone went through the trouble of stealing\na <font_kind=yakuza_italic>detective's</font_kind> gun just to kill Shintani?)</color>": "",
  "But how?": "",
  "You remember the day he died?": "",
  "Go back to the day Shintani died.\nYou remember?": "",
  "We were having a nice, stiff drink at Tender.\nYou, me, and Kaito.": "",
  "We had a nice buzz going over at Tender.\nKaito was there too.": "",
  "Yeah, I remember.\nThat was my first time meeting Kuroiwa.": "",
  "I hung around after you guys beat it.\nWasn't a while 'til I decided to go home.": "",
  "Thing is, I don't remember\nwhat happened next.": "",
  "Thing is... I don't remember\nwhat happened next.": "",
  "Someone smacked me in the back of the head.\nCrept up so I couldn't see 'em.": "",
  "You got ambushed?\nWhere was this?": "",
  "Close to the bar, I bet... but I'm not sure.\nIt all happened so damn fast.": "",
  "Some great detective work there.": "",
  "Whaddya expect? Whoever knocked me out moved me,\ntoo. That just fucks with things even more.": "",
  "Whaddya expect? Whoever knocked me out\nmoved me, too. That just fucks with things even more.": "",
  "Moved you to where?": "",
  "To where?": "",
  "Random bench, over in\nthe Kamurocho Children's Park.": "",
  "Some random bench.\nOver in the Kamurocho Children's Park.": "",
  "Not a soul around when I came to.": "",
  "That's a ways from Tender.\nThey must have taken you in a car.": "",
  "How long were you out for?": "",
  "Hour or so, tops.": "",
  "But as I found out later,\nthat hour's when Shintani was murdered.": "",
  "...With my fucking gun.": "",
  "So the real killer still has your gun?": "",
  "Nah, it was in its holster when I woke up.": "",
  "Nah, it was in its holster\nwhen I woke up.": "",
  "Whoever attacked me took my gun,\nmurdered Shintani...": "",
  "Whoever attacked me took my gun,\nmurdered Shintani with it...": "",
  "...then put it back where they found it,\nall within the course of an hour.": "",
  "...then put it back where they found it.\nAll within the course of an hour.": "",
  "So the only thing missing was a bullet?": "",
  "Just... missing a bullet?": "",
  "Not even that, if you'd believe it.\nThey got rid of any sign it'd ever been used.": "",
  "Maybe if we look at the bullet\nfrom Shintani's body...": "",
  "Maybe... if we look at the bullet\nfrom Shintani's body...": "",
  "Not gonna happen.\nNothing spectacular about a single bullet.": "",
  "A single mass-produced bullet\nwon't prove a thing. Don't bother.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So we can't prove the murderer\nstole the gun...)</color>": "",
  "By the way.\nDid you tell anyone you got attacked?": "",
  "By the way, Ayabe. Did you tell anyone\nyou got attacked? Or make a formal report?": "",
  "Nope. I mean, nothing even got stolen.\nReporting it just would've put me in more trouble.": "",
  "Nope. Nothing even got stolen, and reporting it\nwould have been... trouble.": "",
  "Don't wanna draw attention\nto your side job, huh?": "",
  "Don't wanna draw attention\nto your side job, huh?　": "",
  "Sucks being a dirty cop.\nA real detective could've reported it.": "",
  "...Can't argue there.": "",
  "Well, ya got me there.": "",
  "The culprit must've been\ncounting on that, though.": "",
  "They went after you specifically 'cause\nthey knew you wouldn't make a big deal out of it.": "",
  "So it was all planned...": "",
  "Planned or not, the bullet that killed Shintani\nended up with your gun's rifling marks on it.": "",
  "So, we know the bullet that killed Shintani\nended up with your gun's rifling marks on it.": "",
  "There's no denying that.": "",
  "Yup. I only found out when\nthey hauled me in, though.": "",
  "I only found out when\nthey hauled me in.": "",
  "...No surprise they'd suspect me.\nThere's no reason not to at this point.": "",
  "No surprise they'd suspect me.\nThere's no reason <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> to at this point.": "",
  "But none of my coworkers\nsaid a damn word.": "",
  "Thing is, none of my coworkers\nsaid a damn word.": "",
  "Hey, y'know how Kuroiwa's been\ndragging me all over town with him?": "",
  "Y'know how Kuroiwa's been\ndragging me all over town with him?": "",
  "He prob'ly just wanted to make sure I didn't\nskip town. Only just realized that now.": "",
  "Prob'ly wanted to make sure I didn't skip town.\nWell, in hindsight, anyway.": "",
  "What did you say as your alibi?\nThat you were knocked out in the park?": "",
  "Not a very believable story...": "",
  "C'mon, you and I both know I didn't kill him.\nSomebody's pinnin' it on me!": "",
  "We both know I didn't kill Shintani.\nSomebody's pinnin' it on me!": "",
  "Whaddya say, Yagami?\nYou think I got a chance?": "",
  "Well, Yagami? This looks pretty bad.\nThink I got a chance?": "",
  "You'll be just fine.": "",
  "...Yeah, you'll be fine.": "",
  "Well...\nGuess that was a dumb question.": "",
  "Nah... that was a dumb question.": "",
  "Nobody's gonna tell a guy his head's\non the chopping block.": "",
  "What're you s'posed to say?\n\"Your head's on the chopping block\"?": "",
  "Listen up, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Ayabe was set up by whoever killed Shintani.\nThat's what we've gotta work to prove.": "",
  "Ayabe was set up by the real killer.\nThat's what we've gotta work to prove.": "",
  "You really trust Ayabe-san?\nWhat if he's lying to us?": "",
  "And... you really believe\nAyabe-san's story?": "",
  "He might be a dark stain on the force,\nbut he's a decent guy. Smart, too.": "",
  "Ayabe might be... a dark stain on the force,\nbut he's a decent, pretty smart guy.": "",
  "He wouldn't kill, especially not\nwith his own gun. Someone else did this.": "",
  "He wouldn't kill, especially not with his own gun.\nSomeone else did this.": "",
  "You think it's the Mole?": "",
  "So... you think it's the Mole?": "",
  "That's the most obvious suspect.": "",
  "Yeah. Well, that's the\nmost obvious suspect.": "",
  "Let's start by talking to someone close\nto the case. I've got a guy in mind.": "",
  "For starters, I need to look into someone\nclose to the Mole.": "",
  "Which would be...\nOh. Captain Hamura.": "",
  "Who's close to the Mole...?\nOh! Captain Hamura?": "",
  "But nobody knows where he is, right?": "",
  "But... we don't even know\nwhere he is, right?": "",
  "That's true...": "",
  "Maybe not.": "",
  "I wonder what Matsugane-san's\nthoughts are, though.": "",
  "But something hit me.\nMatsugane-san's been pretty quiet.": "",
  "If anyone's gonna know where\nto find Hamura, it's him.": "",
  "Maybe he'll have some clues.": "",
  "Good.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "...Probably not.": "...คงไม่หรอกมั้ง",
  "...Sorry.": "...ขอโทษ",
  "Sorry...": "ขอโทษ...",
  "That's true...": "ก็จริงนะ...",
  "Maybe not.": "คงไม่เอาดีกว่า",
  "Good.": "ดี"
 }
}
